---

## 📱 Application Modules

### 🩸 Donor Registration

Allows users to register themselves as blood donors by providing
the required donor information.

### 🚨 Blood Request

Allows users to submit their blood requirements when blood is needed.

### 🔎 Donor Finder

Helps users search for suitable donors based on their blood group.

### 👤 Donor Information

Displays available donor information required for connecting with
potential donors.

